          Rather than partitioning purely on functional lines, Jedis structured their system decomposition to match business milestones: Phase 1 (Fridge unlocking and payment capture); Phase 2 (Subscriptions and loyalty rewards); Phase 3 (Machine learning analytics and personalized diet recommendations).
