        <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-4">
          Defining subdomain boundaries clarifies which component owns which data model, but introduces a deeper architectural question: how do we keep distributed state synchronized when physical purchases happen in the real world? This brings storage models and data consistency to center stage.
