              <span>↗</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/TheKataLog/da-Vinci" target="_blank" class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700 hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between transition-all">
              <span>⚡ da Vinci (Branch: master)</span>
              <span>↗</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/TheKataLog/Self-Driven-Team" target="_blank" class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700 hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between transition-all">
              <span>⚡ Self-Driven Team (Branch: main)</span>
